          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="3467-0678-083e-eb50">In the Ready step of each Strategy phase, if this operative controls an objective marker that isn&apos;t tainted, that objective marker is tainted for the battle and you gain 1CP. Note that if any operative (including enemy operatives) has tainted an objective marker, you cannot taint that objective marker.</characteristic>
